          "text": "Thoracolumbar back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sudden-onset, constant severe pain for 5 days after a long interstate drive; midline T11–L1, right greater than left. Rated 8/10. Worse with movement, coughing, and lying flat. Patient says it feels deep in the spine, not muscle, and is different from prior mechanical low back pain."
      }
